      "title": "Trump heads to Asia for nuclear talks with Xi, Putin; Ukraine on agenda",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/world-news/trump-heads-to-asia-for-nuclear-talks-with-xi-putin-ukraine-on-agenda-126111601758_1.html",
      "description": "President Donald Trump was preparing to depart for Asia on Monday, turning his focus to economic deals and historic three-way nuclear talks with Russia and China as his administration adjusts to a new political reality in Washington. He said he may meet with Kim Jong Un while in China as the US looks to reengage North Korea on its nuclear program.\nTrump said he plans to talk about Russia's war in Ukraine during the highly anticipated meeting with Chinese President Xi Jinping and Russian leader Vladimir Putin in China.\n\"We'll talk about my favourite subject, Ukraine. Ukraine's losing Ukraine,\" Trump told reporters at the White House on Monday morning before departing for his visit to Asia. \"Russia is losing 25,000 soldiers in the month. So we'll be talking about that.\"\nTrump suggested he'll talk with the leaders about the war even after Trump administration officials on Friday told reporters that Trump would discuss nuclear disarmament and the Iran war with his Chinese and Russian ..",
